<Chapter id="unknowns">
<h2>10. Unresolved portions</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><code>Frnd/33</code> is defined for an empty page; the generated order of a
    non-empty toon-block entry remains unknown.</li>
    <li>Server echo of an outbound <code>Chat/11</code> message still needs explicit
    verification. Automated validation remains passive and never sends chat.</li>
    <li>Numeric public-channel identifiers still need a reliable source of localized
    display names.</li>
    <li>The whisper family (<code>Chat/19</code>, <code>Chat/30</code>), the group
    subsystem (<code>S2Mp/46</code>, <code>51</code>, <code>53</code>, <code>54</code>,
    <code>55</code>), presence targeting (<code>Pres/2</code>, <code>3</code>,
    <code>4</code>), and the toon-resolution routes (<code>Prfl/1</code>,
    <code>3</code>, <code>Frnd/6</code>) now have established command mappings and
    generated wire orders; they are documented in the service reference above.
    <code>Chat/20</code> WhisperUndeliverable is mapped but not yet decoded, and
    services still absent from any capture remain metadata-only.</li>
  </ol>
  <BackToContents />
</Chapter>
